OL,3,GNEWSAProject creates Remembrance
OL,4,Adisplay of 20,000 poppies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community poppy display featuring
OL,7,Fabout 20,000 handmade poppies has been
OL,8,Funveiled ahead of Remembrance Day.
OL,10,FThe Windsor Community Poppy Project
OL,11,Fdisplay at Windsor Parish Church of St
OL,12,FJohn the Baptist opened at a
OL,13,Fcelebration event on Friday and will
OL,14,Fremain on show until 15 November.
OL,16,FSchools and care homes were among the
OL,17,F40 organisations to take part in the
OL,18,Fproject, led by Craft Coop.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
