OL,3,GNEWSAProject creates Remembrance
OL,4,Adisplay of 20,000 poppies
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers said they initially thought
OL,7,Fthey would receive about 10,000 poppies
OL,8,Fbut the help of thousands of volunteers
OL,9,Fmeant they far exceeded those
OL,10,Fexpectations.
